              "value": "**Hadi Pestilence**\nDC: 19\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\n- Stage 1: carrier (1 day)\n- Stage 2: sickened 1 (1 day)\n- Stage 3: drained 1 (1 day)\n- Stage 4: drained 2 (1 day)\n- Stage 5: drained 3 (1 week)\n- Stage 6: transform into a hadi (1 year)"
